Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.48,0:00:56.29,Title,0,0,0,0,,《蜘蛛侠2》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.03,0:03:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,她每天都看着我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She looks at me every day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.16,0:03:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛莉·珍·华森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary Jane Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.13,0:03:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真希望她知道… 我有多爱她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, boy. If she only knew how I felt about her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.33,0:03:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我不能让她知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she can never know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.30,0:03:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我选择为伸张正义奉献一生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made a choice once to live a life of responsibility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.91,0:03:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能让她陷入危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A life she can never be a part of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.38,0:03:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是什么人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who am I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.84,0:03:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是蜘蛛侠 身负神圣使命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Spider-Man, given a job to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.61,0:03:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是彼得·帕克 有一份伟大的工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm Peter Parker, and I, too, have a job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.78,0:03:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕克 帕克…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parker. Parker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.82,0:03:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,停 快停车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, stop! Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.19,0:03:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你迟到了 你老是迟到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parker, you're late, man. Always late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.02,0:03:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我被一件事耽搁了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Mr. Aziz. There was a disturbance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.13,0:03:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 你每次都搞这种飞机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another disturbance. Always a disturbance with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.56,0:03:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,21分钟前有人叫了披萨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ome on, 21 minutes ago, in comes order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.53,0:03:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,浩然法律事务所 八个松厚饼皮什锦口味披萨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harmattan, Burton & Smith. Eight etra-large deep-dish pizzas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.11,0:03:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说过 那种语言我不懂啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, I don't understand that language.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.27,0:03:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 讲英文 - 你不会做披萨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Speak English. - You can't make pizza.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.38,0:03:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会？开玩笑… 我做了五年的披萨了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't? I've been making pizza five years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.41,0:03:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,八分钟内不送到 就超过29分钟送达的保证{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In eight minutes, I am defaulting on Joe's 29-minute guarantee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.38,0:04:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样一来 我不但收不到钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, not only am I receiving no money for these pizzas…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.48,0:04:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,连这个大客户都会被对手抢走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but I will lose the customer forever to Pizza Yurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.29,0:04:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么不派萨利姆去？- 萨利姆昨天被赶走啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why didn't you send Saleem? - Saleem was deported yesterday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.66,0:04:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看我的乳酪披萨怎样？- 开心一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look… Smiley. - What about my cheese pizza?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.83,0:04:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我全靠你了 你要准时送到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you are my only hope, all right? You have to make it in time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.40,0:04:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你人很好 只是很不可靠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter, you're a nice guy. But you're just not dependable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.53,0:04:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你最后一次机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your last chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.54,0:04:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,七分半钟内赶到那 不然我就炒你鱿鱼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to go 42 blocks in 71 l2 minutes or your ass is fired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.94,0:04:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.00,0:04:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你猪头呀？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what, are you stupid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.52,0:05:15.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他抢了那家伙的披萨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! He stole that guy's pizzas!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.40,0:05:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去捡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.62,0:05:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,小朋友 别在大马路玩耍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you guys. No playing in the streets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.12,0:05:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 蜘蛛侠哥哥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Mr. Spider-Man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.69,0:05:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,回头见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.49,0:05:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,帅哟 蜘蛛侠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Way to go, Spidey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.93,0:07:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,披萨送来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pizza time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.57,0:07:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你迟到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.11,0:07:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会付钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not paying for those.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.63,0:07:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,电梯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elevator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.98,0:07:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证29分钟内把披萨送达{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joe's 29-minute guarantee is a promise, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.68,0:07:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不把这保证当回事 我却是很认真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know to you, Parker, a promise means nothing. But to me, it's serious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.35,0:07:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也很认真呀 老板{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's serious to me too, Mr. Aziz.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.49,0:08:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你被开除了 走吧 - 我需要这份工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're fired. Go. - Please, I need this ob.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.16,0:08:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你被开除了 - 再给我一次机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're fired. - Look, give me another chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.87,0:08:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被开除了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're fired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.57,0:08:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 帕克 你被开除了 - 为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Parker, hello. You're fired. - Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.74,0:08:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,接飞盘的小狗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dogs catching Frisbees?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.41,0:08:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,公园里的鸽子 两个下棋的老头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pigeons in the park? A couple geezers playing chess?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.88,0:08:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老板 - 别烦我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Boss. - Not now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.28,0:08:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想呈现纽约市温馨的一面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Bugle could show another side of New York for a change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.18,0:08:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,六分钟后截稿 缺头版版面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got si minutes to deadline, Jonah. We need page one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.28,0:08:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我付你钱不是让你搞艺术 我叫你别烦我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't pay you to be a sensitive artiste. I pay you… Still not now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.85,0:08:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为蜘蛛侠只肯让你拍照{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pay you because that psycho Spider-Man will pose for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.62,0:08:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不肯让我拍照了 你害他成为全民公敌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't let me take any more pictures. You turned the whole city against him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.29,0:08:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可得意的咧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fact I'm very proud of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.96,0:08:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这些恶心照片拿走 免得我把隔夜饭吐出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your pretty little portfolio off my desk before I go into a diabetic coma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.90,0:08:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你太太说她把支票簿搞丢了 - 这真是好消息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's your wife, she lost her checkbook. - Thanks for the good news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.44,0:08:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你连一张都不肯采用吗？我真的很缺钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, isn't there any of these shots you can use? I need the money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.14,0:08:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,布小姐 快拿纸巾来 让擦我眼泪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Brant. Get me a violin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.14,0:08:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,只剩五分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five minutes to deadline, Jonah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.01,0:08:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,登一张死鸡照片 头条是：{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Un a picture of a rancid chicken. Here's the headline:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.88,0:08:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,「禽流感侵袭纽约市」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Food Poisoning Scare Sweeps ity."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.95,0:09:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 吃炸鸡都会中毒吗？- 我不是说我快吐了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Some food got poisoned? - I'm a little nauseous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.42,0:09:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 詹老板{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Mr. Jameson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.99,0:09:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,逊毙了 这就是头条新闻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It stinks. Obbie, there's your page one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.33,0:09:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒙面大坏蛋威胁纽约市{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Masked Menace Terrorizes Town."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.13,0:09:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他并不是大坏蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, he's not a menace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.86,0:09:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我警告你… - 我马上去办{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I told you… - I'll take care of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.63,0:09:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我付你一百五十美元 - 三百美元{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll give you 150. - Three hundred.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.67,0:09:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,太贵了啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's outrageous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.10,0:09:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 拿去领钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Done. Give this to the girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.24,0:09:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 再见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Bye-bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.90,0:09:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.64,0:09:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 彼得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Pete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.04,0:09:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不够还你上次预支的钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think this covers the advance I gave you a couple weeks ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.22,0:09:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对喔 - 抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ight. - Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.38,0:09:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.12,0:09:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,抬起头来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hin up, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.83,0:09:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,走路小心点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch it, jerk!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.98,0:10:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,康博士 对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Onnors. Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.08,0:10:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where were you headed, Parker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.85,0:10:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,上你的课呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To your class.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.25,0:10:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的课上完了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My class is over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.25,0:10:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没看到我站在这儿吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See me standing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.62,0:10:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我很努力想赶来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I'm trying. I wanna be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.59,0:10:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就要准时上课{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.30,0:10:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you, Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.30,0:10:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的成绩一落千丈 上课老是迟到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your grades have been steadily declining. You're late for class.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.80,0:10:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总是疲惫不堪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always appear ehausted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.14,0:10:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也还没交核融合的报告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your paper on fusion is still overdue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.38,0:10:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我计划写巴奥图博士的研究{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I'm planning to write it on Dr. Otto Octavius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.71,0:10:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,大学没有计划这门科系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Planning is not a maor at this university.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.19,0:10:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴博士是我的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Octavius is a friend of mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.52,0:10:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要好好写报告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better do your research, Parker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.86,0:10:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,交不出来 我就会把你当掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it done, or I'm failing you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.42,0:11:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,惊喜！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surprise!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.72,0:11:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,说话呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, say something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.82,0:11:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是什么大日子？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the occasion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.25,0:11:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你忘啦 今天是你的生日{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eally, Peter. It's your birthday!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.36,0:11:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看你自己都忘了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whether you want to remember it or not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.53,0:11:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他活在另一个世界 对吧 彼得？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lives in another reality. Don't you, Pete?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.00,0:11:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 玛莉 - 嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi, M.J. - Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.43,0:11:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好兄弟 - 嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, buddy. - Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.97,0:11:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好久不见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long time, no see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.10,0:11:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你演的舞台剧受到好评{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how's the play? I read a great review.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.41,0:11:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,进行得挺顺利的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's going fine. It's going good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.28,0:11:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,她演得超棒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's brilliant in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.71,0:11:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利送我玫瑰花{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harry sent me roses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.55,0:11:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么都不回我电话？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where you been, pal? You don't return my calls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.58,0:11:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最近很忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been busy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.62,0:11:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,忙着替蜘蛛侠拍照？那只害虫近来好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taking pictures of Spider-Man? How's the bug these days?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.36,0:11:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个人你最好少见为妙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The less you see of that man, the better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.49,0:11:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家到餐厅吃饭吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, let's all go into the other room and have something to eat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.13,0:11:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去拿点心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get the hors d'oeuvres.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.56,0:12:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在奥氏企业做得怎样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how are things going at Oscorp?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.86,0:12:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 我现在是特别计划的总监{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're great. I'm head of Special Proects.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.90,0:12:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的核融合研究有重大突破{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're about to make a breakthrough on fusion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.30,0:12:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真能干 你父亲在天之灵一定以你为荣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How lovely, Harry. Your father would be so proud, rest his soul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.57,0:12:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.28,0:12:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在资助你的偶像巴奥图博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're actually funding one of your idols, Pete. Otto Octavius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.21,0:12:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我正在写他的报告 - 你想见他吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm writing a paper on him. - You want to meet him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.82,0:12:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯带我去见他？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd introduce me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.25,0:12:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然啰 他会帮助奥氏企业达到…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bet. Octavius is gonna put Oscorp on the map…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.62,0:12:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,连我爸也梦想不到的成就{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in a way my father never even dreamed of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.82,0:12:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛莉 过来帮忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}M.J., could you give me a hand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.13,0:12:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在等着你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's waiting for you, pal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.43,0:12:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.83,0:12:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一直忍不住在偷瞄你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way she looks at you or doesn't look at you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.83,0:12:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你看不出来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}However you want to look at it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.57,0:12:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在没时间交女友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have time for girls right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.90,0:12:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是猪头吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, are you dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.41,0:12:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最近很忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been kind of busy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.17,0:12:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,忙着替你朋友拍照？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taking pictures of your friend?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.24,0:12:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再提了 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ould we get off that subect?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.28,0:12:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望我们成为朋友 哈利 互相信任{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want us to be friends, Harry. I want us to trust each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.45,0:12:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就老实说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then be honest with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.55,0:12:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他是谁… 会告诉我吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you knew who he was, would you tell me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.06,0:13:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得 难道你一点都不了解我的感受？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter, don't you understand how I feel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.59,0:13:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要这家伙去见阎王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want this guy dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.70,0:13:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要杀你班叔的凶手死得跟班叔一样惨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The same way you want the guy who killed your Uncle Ben dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.04,0:13:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我真的不是故意要在你生日这天说教{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I don't mean to rag on you on your birthday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.65,0:13:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我的好兄弟 你知道的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're my buddy, you know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.15,0:13:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是家人 彼得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're family, Pete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.82,0:13:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲过去这么疼你 就像疼亲生儿子一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father loved you. You were like a son to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.09,0:13:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 哈利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Harry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.65,0:14:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,（查封通知）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.86,0:14:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}May.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.53,0:14:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,班 什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, what, Ben?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.44,0:14:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.60,0:14:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 梅婶 - 哎呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aunt May. - Oh, my.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.44,0:14:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得 原来是你 我还以为我回到从前了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Peter. Oh, for a second there, I thought I was years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.85,0:14:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都走了 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody's gone, aren't they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.22,0:14:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们开不开心？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did they have a good time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.38,0:14:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,很开心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure they did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.49,0:14:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吧？- 很好 你回去吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay? - Of course. But you go home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.93,0:14:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点 骑摩托车很危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And be careful. I don't like that scooter thing you drive around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.86,0:14:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很担心你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm worried about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.50,0:14:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一个人孤零零的 我也看到银行寄来的信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're so alone. And I saw the letter from the bank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.64,0:14:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是的 你看到了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my. You did?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.57,0:14:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.08,0:15:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.08,0:15:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的经济状况不好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a little behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.75,0:15:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.15,0:15:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想再谈了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, I don't want to talk about it anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.29,0:15:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我累了 你也该回家了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm tired, and you better start back home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.79,0:15:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿去 生日快乐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, kiddo. Happy birthday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.69,0:15:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你比我更需要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need it more than I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.46,0:15:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不能拿 - 当然能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, I can't take that from you. - Yes, you can!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.17,0:15:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你就拿去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can take this money from me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.37,0:15:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这没多少钱 拿去吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For God's sake, it's not much. Now, take it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.27,0:15:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,别偷偷留下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And don't you dare leave it here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.94,0:15:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.08,0:15:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是太想你的班叔叔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just that I miss your uncle Ben so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.75,0:15:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,下个月就是他逝世两周年忌日{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An you believe that it's two years net month since he was taken?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.02,0:15:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有时候会想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think to myself at times…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.39,0:15:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我该为他的死负责{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…were I to face the one responsible for what happened, I'd…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.73,0:15:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真不知该如何是好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I don't know what I'd do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.31,0:16:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.81,0:16:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,把生日蛋糕带回去吃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you better take the rest of your cake home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.29,0:16:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.96,0:16:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. You're still here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.20,0:16:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到你的广告板{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw your billboard on Bleecker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.97,0:16:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好笑吧 我有够丑了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't it funny? I'm really kind of embarrassed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.50,0:16:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点也不会 我每天都能看到你真好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be. It's nice. I get to see you every day now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.64,0:16:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个摄影师喜欢我的脸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The photographer liked my face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.21,0:16:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为 我只会出现在目录里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was only supposed to be in the catalogue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.25,0:16:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来我拿到那部戏的角色 好像一瞬间实现了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I got the part in the play. Everything at once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.92,0:16:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的梦想成真了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dream came true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.55,0:16:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about yours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.36,0:16:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还可以啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.43,0:17:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你能来看这出剧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish you'd come see the play.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.96,0:17:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总是一直鼓励我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one who always encouraged me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.00,0:17:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是想去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I plan to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.94,0:17:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天我见到你好开心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I liked seeing you tonight, Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.51,0:17:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, boy, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.91,0:17:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Oh, boy, yeah" what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.36,0:17:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.29,0:17:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想对我说什么吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to say something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.24,0:17:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.78,0:17:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想问…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…was…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.05,0:17:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还住在东区吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…wondering if you're still in the Village.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.46,0:18:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真搞不懂你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're such a mystery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.74,0:18:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.94,0:18:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.45,0:18:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,生日快乐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy birthday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.86,0:18:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正与一个人见面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm seeing somebody now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.06,0:18:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喔 是去治疗 - 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Therapy. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.43,0:18:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人 一个男人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A person, a man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.27,0:18:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是你男朋友吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean, like a boyfriend?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.80,0:18:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我挺喜欢他的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, like I like him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.67,0:18:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.84,0:18:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.28,0:18:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,交男朋友很好呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good, you know? Ompanionship…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.22,0:19:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也许他不只是男朋友 - 不只是？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- May be more than that. - More?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.29,0:19:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不晓得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.06,0:19:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明晚会去看你的舞台剧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming to see your play tomorrow night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.33,0:19:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的吗？- 我一定会到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're coming? - I'll be there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.27,0:19:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让我失望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't disappoint me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.40,0:19:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.29,0:19:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,房租{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.66,0:19:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 嗨你的头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi. - Hi. What's "Hi"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.49,0:19:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的房租咧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An I spend it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.76,0:19:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这礼拜会领薪水{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a paycheck due this week and…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.83,0:19:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的房租又迟交了一个月 - 我保证…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're a month late again. Again. - I promise as soon as…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.37,0:19:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果保证能当饭吃 我女儿早就变成胖妹了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If promises were crackers, my daughter would be fat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.44,0:20:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的很抱歉 这是我这星期的生活费{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really sorry, Mr. Ditkovitch. All I got is this 20 for the rest of the week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.61,0:20:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,道歉也没用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Sorry" doesn't pay the rent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.35,0:20:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次别溜进来 我的耳朵跟猫一样灵 眼睛跟老鼠一样尖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And don't try to sneak past me. I have ears like a cat and eyes like a rodent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.89,0:20:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多谢了 房东先生 - 嗨 彼得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks, Mr. Ditkovitch. - Hi, Pete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.61,0:21:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.59,0:21:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,房租咧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ent?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.39,0:21:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 奥先生来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor? Mr. Osborn's here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.93,0:21:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺贝尔奖是你的囊中物 我们都会发大财{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobel Prize, Otto. Nobel Prize. And we'll all be rich.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.10,0:21:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是为了得奖 哈利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not about the prizes, Harry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.90,0:21:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你需要奥氏企业的资金{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you need money. You need Oscorp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.87,0:21:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who do we have here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.27,0:21:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你提过的超级天才{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my good friend I called you about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.17,0:21:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他帮我完成高中理工科{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got me through high-school science.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.01,0:21:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是彼得·帕克 我正在写关于你的报告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter Parker, sir. I'm writing a paper on you for…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.24,0:21:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你来的目的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you're doing here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.85,0:21:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我没空跟大学生闲扯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but I don't have time to talk to students now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.02,0:21:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过奥氏企业是我的大金主{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Oscorp pays the bills, so…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.02,0:21:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我得去参加董事会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I have to take off. Board meeting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.52,0:21:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这两个天才… 就好好聊聊吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But my ob is done here. Got you two geniuses together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.06,0:21:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝明天好运 诺贝尔奖是你的 瑞典见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck tomorrow, Otto. Nobel Prize. We'll see you in Sweden!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.36,0:22:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你朋友挺有意思的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interesting fellow, your friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.50,0:22:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会占用你太多时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't take much of your time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.37,0:22:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得你是老康的学生 他说你头脑很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I remember you. You're onnors' student. He tells me you're brilliant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.51,0:22:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也说你很懒惰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He also tells me you're lazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.61,0:22:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定会改进{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to do better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.01,0:22:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,头脑好还不够 你一定要努力向上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being brilliant's not enough, young man. You have to work hard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.95,0:22:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,聪明不是特权 那是一种天赋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Intelligence is not a privilege, it's a gift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.29,0:22:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要用来造福人类{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you use it for the good of mankind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.45,0:22:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥图 你的午餐准备好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otto, your lunch is ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.16,0:22:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是我太太 萝丝 - 你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is my wife, osie. - Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.09,0:22:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是彼得·帕克 康博士的学生 上课打瞌睡那个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Peter Parker. Onnors' student. The one who falls asleep in class.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.76,0:22:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我上物理课老是睡着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always fell asleep in physics class.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.00,0:22:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很高兴见到你 彼得 - 我也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nice to meet you, Peter. - Good to meet you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.00,0:22:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ecuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.07,0:22:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这个吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.47,0:22:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 完成并维持核融合的机器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. My design to initiate and sustain fusion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.71,0:22:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你使用原子的谐波频率{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand you use harmonics of atomic frequencies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.75,0:22:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实是共振频率{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sympathetic frequencies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.28,0:22:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,借以加强核融合的效果？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harmonic reinforcement?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.65,0:22:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.95,0:23:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后产生出强大的能量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An eponential increase in energy output.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.66,0:23:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,无穷无尽的能量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A huge amount of energy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.49,0:23:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像太阳一样 提供无穷无尽的能源{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a perpetual sun providing renewable power for the whole world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.83,0:23:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,太神奇了 如果成功 它可以改变将来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all so amazing. If it works, it could change the way we live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.17,0:23:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是很神奇 而且一定会成功的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is amazing, and it will work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.37,0:23:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能稳定核融合反应吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure you could stabilize the fusion reaction?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.07,0:23:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这一个半小时都在说什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter, what have we been talking about for the last hour and a half?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.91,0:23:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我毕生的心血结晶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my life's work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.98,0:23:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道计算错误的严重后果{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I certainly know the consequences of the slightest miscalculation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.32,0:23:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我不该质疑你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I didn't mean to question you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.72,0:23:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位小朋友认为 我会把纽约炸掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Osie, our new friend thinks I'm gonna blow up the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.29,0:23:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今晚可以高枕无忧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can sleep soundly tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.26,0:23:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的研究无懈可击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otto's done his homework.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.16,0:23:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天来看测试 你就知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ome to the demonstration tomorrow, and you'll see for yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.73,0:23:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你倒是要好好睡一觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you need to sleep soundly tonight, Otto.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.10,0:23:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱迪生发明电灯前有睡吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did Edison sleep before he turned on the light?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.73,0:23:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,马可尼发明无线电前有睡吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did Marconi sleep before he turned on the radio?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.24,0:23:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝多芬写第五交响曲前有睡吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did Beethoven sleep before he wrote the 5th?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.54,0:23:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯努利在发明最小作用量原理前合过眼吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did Bernoulli sleep before he found the curves of quickest descent?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.14,0:23:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很欣赏这个年轻人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Osie, I love this boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.68,0:23:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈谈你自己 你有女朋友吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter, tell us about yourself. Do you have a girlfriend?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.52,0:24:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个嘛…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.19,0:24:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道耶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't really know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.75,0:24:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是应该知道吗？你不知道谁知道？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, shouldn't you know? I mean, who would know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.09,0:24:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,别逼他 也许这是秘密{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave him alone. Maybe it's a secret love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.23,0:24:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱不应该是秘密{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love should never be a secret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.43,0:24:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,把爱这么复杂的事藏在心底{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you keep something as complicated as love stored up inside…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.30,0:24:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定会把自己逼疯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…gonna make you sick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.67,0:24:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很幸运 能找到真爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I finally got lucky in love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.67,0:24:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.17,0:24:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但绝非完美 爱要努力经营{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's hardly perfect. You have to work at it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.04,0:24:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们同校 一开始我就知道会很辛苦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I met him on the college steps, and I knew it wasn't going to be easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.91,0:24:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他念理工 我念英国文学{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was studying science, and I was studying English literature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.35,0:24:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试着跟她解释相对论{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. I was trying to eplain the theory of relativity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.69,0:24:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,她试着跟我解释艾略特的诗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And osie was trying to eplain T.S. Eliot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.56,0:24:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,在时间与过去时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time present and time past{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.16,0:24:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 两者都可能是现在时间吗？- 可能是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are both perhaps present - Perhaps present{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.36,0:24:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在未来的时间 - 「在未来的时间」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- In time future - In time future{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.83,0:24:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全看不懂他在写什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still don't understand what he was talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.93,0:24:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道啦 - 我是说真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, you do. - I'm serious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.34,0:24:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾略特的诗比科学更深奥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}T.S. Eliot is more complicated than advanced science.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.44,0:25:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你想追女孩 就读诗给她听{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you want to get a woman to fall in love with you, feed her poetry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.14,0:25:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,读诗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poetry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.01,0:25:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,屡试不爽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never fails.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.68,0:25:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,（自助洗衣店）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.58,0:25:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,（朗费罗叶慈）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.02,0:25:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个身材高挑修长的少女 独自站在草原上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A tall and slender maiden All alone upon a prairie{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.12,0:25:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,她身穿着翠绿色衣裳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brightest green were all her garments{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.66,0:25:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,秀发有如阳光般闪亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And her hair was like the sunshine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.43,0:25:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他日复一日凝视着她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Day by day he gazed upon her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.55,0:26:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,（不可儿戏）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.32,0:26:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,房租{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ent!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.86,0:26:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的钱咧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is my money?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.22,0:26:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今晚好像很紧张{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seem ittery tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.69,0:26:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远不知道什么人会来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never know who's coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.52,0:26:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,（康乃馨 三美元一束）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.80,0:27:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 五分钟后开演{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies, five minutes. Five minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.96,0:27:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么这么厉害？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.30,0:27:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,多运动 多休息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Work out, plenty of rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.83,0:27:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有多吃青菜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, eat your green vegetables.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.57,0:27:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈也这么说 我以前都不信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what my mom is always saying. I just never actually believed her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.84,0:27:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ome on. Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.15,0:27:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳着点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it steady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.07,0:28:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一张蜘蛛网{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a web.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.71,0:28:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜘蛛侠 加油{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, Spidey, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.41,0:28:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,有麻烦了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got trouble!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.37,0:28:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,放我下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.61,0:28:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很相信孟先生说的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am more than content with what Mr. Moncrieff said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.61,0:28:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,光是听到他的声音 就令人放心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His voice alone inspires one with absolute credulity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.08,0:28:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们该原谅他们吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you think we should forgive them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.08,0:29:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.25,0:29:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说不对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.06,0:29:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 你违规停车会被拖吊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Hey. Hey, chief. You park there, I'm towing it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.00,0:29:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,随你便{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.93,0:29:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,鞋带松了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoelace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.04,0:29:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,领带也应该…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might want to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.08,0:29:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能效劳吗？- 我是来看戏的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- an I help you? - Yeah, I've come to see the show.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.39,0:29:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 开演后就不能进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm sorry, sir. No one will be seated after the doors are closed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.42,0:29:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样才不会打扰到观众{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It helps maintain the illusion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.49,0:29:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.40,0:29:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,华森小姐请我来看戏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Watson, she's a friend of mine. She asked me to come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.00,0:29:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她没请你迟到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not to come late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.94,0:29:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定要进去 让我站在…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to see this show. Just let me in, I'll stand in the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.91,0:30:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,（演出时 请保持安静）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.12,0:30:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你难道不能…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, can't you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.30,0:30:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜘蛛侠啊蜘蛛侠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Spider-Man A Spider-Man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.40,0:30:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞檐走壁 铲奸除恶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-does whatever a spider can{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.57,0:30:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,吐出蜘蛛丝 织成蜘蛛网{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-spins a web, any size{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.74,0:30:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏人就像苍蝇自投罗网{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catches thieves a-just like flies{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.28,0:30:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 蜘蛛侠来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out Here comes the Spider-Man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.37,0:30:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天你真的不一起来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure you don't wanna come tonight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.10,0:31:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.64,0:31:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 打电话给我 - 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. All me. - I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.71,0:31:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你今晚演得很棒 - 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You were great tonight. - Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.91,0:31:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,大明星 请你帮我签名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I have an autograph, please, miss?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.81,0:31:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会跑来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.30,0:31:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,饿了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hungry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.70,0:31:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,饿扁了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.52,0:32:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.96,0:32:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.26,0:33:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么样啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.66,0:33:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.63,0:33:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想告诉你 我真的很喜欢你所做的一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanna say, I really like what you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.90,0:33:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想那很棒 - 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Think it's great. - Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.37,0:33:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和艾森豪 安德森 尼寇斯和纳德森…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm with Weisenhower, Anderson, Nichols & Knudsen…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.71,0:33:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这大楼的PR公司{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…P firm in the building…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.58,0:33:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你的表现 真的是太棒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and I just wanna say I think the image you have is fantastic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.58,0:33:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,组合得完美无缺 这套装束 还有… 这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's really put together. The costume. The… this thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.59,0:33:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 组合得恰恰好 真是太好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's really put together. It's great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.19,0:33:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得 你不应该只局限在平面印刷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you could do more than print though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.29,0:33:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以试试看电视节目 你说呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you might wanna try some TV, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.20,0:33:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我帮忙过目吗？说不定会有哪些新点子？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An I riff for you? Ome up with a couple ideas?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.53,0:33:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,在公司能用上？看 我们现在手上有什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just what my company would do? Let's see, what do I got?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.47,0:33:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,童书怎么样？你可以…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about a children's book? You could…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.37,0:33:51.20,Title,0,0,0,0,,像《夏洛的网》 不过没有小猪…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like Charlotte's Web, but without the pig. That kind of thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.37,0:33:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,吊床的绳索怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about a line of hammocks?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.91,0:33:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为它是网子一样的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it's kind of a web thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.41,0:34:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你或许能制造一种「抛射魅力」的男人古龙水{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could do a men's cologne called Thwip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.98,0:34:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的名片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me give you a card.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.82,0:34:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有口袋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have any pockets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.79,0:34:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.99,0:34:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正好就在大楼中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we're right in the building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.71,0:34:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我常常这样 那没有用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That doesn't help. I do that all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.01,0:34:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 慢速电梯 - 是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Slow elevator. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.63,0:34:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此 从一次项摄动能量中…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thus, the second-order term…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.27,0:34:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,计算出来的二次项{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in the epansion of the eact order…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.17,0:35:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,和从展开式中… 精确项次的二次项{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is identical to the second order…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.68,0:35:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是完全相同的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…calculated from first-order perturbation energy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.35,0:35:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,能自由选择一个源源不绝的能量供应{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since we are free to choose an arbitrary origin for our energy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.58,0:35:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,（巴氏融合？能量过高？轰！）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.09,0:35:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,（玛莉）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.84,0:35:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我 请在哔声后留言{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. It's me. Sing your song at the beep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.41,0:35:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛莉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, M.J.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.81,0:35:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我彼得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.65,0:35:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚我赶去看你的戏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was on my way to your show and…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.02,0:35:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我骑着摩托车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I was on my bike…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.46,0:35:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在家吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.63,0:35:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的计划了一整天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really was planning on it all day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.77,0:35:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.74,0:36:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 你早料到我会让你失望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I know you predicted I'd disappoint you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.40,0:36:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那还用说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bingo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.04,0:36:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是不可思议{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's amazing, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.64,0:36:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我连八点准时到… 这么简单的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How complicated a simple thing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.71,0:36:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,都会把它搞得这么复杂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…like being someplace at 8:00 can become.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.62,0:36:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实都怪那讨厌的影作员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, there was this obnoxious usher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.23,0:36:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该有人去警告他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody has to talk to that usher, M.J.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.53,0:36:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,通话时间到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your time has expired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.23,0:36:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,请再投入五毛钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please deposit 50 cents for the next five minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.18,0:36:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很想告诉你实话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna tell you the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.42,0:36:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.89,0:36:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是蜘蛛侠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Spider-Man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.69,0:36:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇怪吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weird, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.92,0:36:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我不能跟你在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you know why I can't be with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.36,0:37:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我的敌人 知道你的存在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If my enemies found out about you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.87,0:37:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你因此受伤 我会永远自责{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…if you got hurt, I could never forgive myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.98,0:37:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真希望… 能说出我对你的爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could tell you how I feel about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.49,0:37:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位先生 女士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.93,0:37:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟内人欢迎各位大驾光临{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…my wife osie and I would like to welcome you this afternoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.93,0:37:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我要先问一声{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But first, before we start…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.77,0:37:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁丢了一捆用橡皮筋绑的钞票？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…has anybody lost a large roll of 20-dollar bills in a rubber band?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.57,0:37:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只找到橡皮筋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we found the rubber band.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.74,0:37:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好冷的笑话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a terrible oke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.35,0:37:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢各位大驾光临{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But thank you for coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.41,0:37:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.82,0:37:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位将目睹一种新能源的诞生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you will witness the birth of a new fusion-based energy source.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.65,0:38:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种安全永续性能源 为所有人提供廉价电力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safe, renewable energy and cheap electricity for everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.19,0:38:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要介绍我的助手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now let me introduce my assistants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.14,0:38:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这四只机械手臂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These four actuators were developed and programmed…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.31,0:38:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是为了处理核融合而设计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for the sole purpose of creating successful fusion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.95,0:38:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们能抗高温和磁力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are impervious to heat and magnetism.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.16,0:39:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的大脑透过神经连结… 操控这些具有人工智慧的机械手臂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These smart arms are controlled by my brain through a neural link.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.53,0:39:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳米神经导线 直接传递指令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nanowires feed directly into my cerebellum…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.50,0:39:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我在极度危险的环境{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…allowing me to use these arms to control fusion reaction…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.77,0:39:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,使用机械手臂… 控制核融合反应{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in an environment no human hand could enter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.77,0:39:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些机械手臂具有…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor, if the artificial intelligence in the arms…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.38,0:39:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么先进的人工智慧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is as advanced as you suggest…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.35,0:39:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会反被它们控制吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…couldn't that make you vulnerable to them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.55,0:39:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,问得好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How right you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.98,0:39:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我研发了一枚抑制晶片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why I developed this inhibitor chip…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.22,0:39:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护我的大脑功能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to protect my higher brain function.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.75,0:39:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我左右这些机械手臂的行动 而不是被它控制{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means I maintain control of these arms, instead of them controlling me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.03,0:39:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,压轴好戏开始了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now on to the main event.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.03,0:39:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,请打蓝灯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the blue light, osie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.55,0:40:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,最重要的关键是 稀有的氚元素{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Precious tritium is the fuel that makes this proect go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.55,0:40:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,全地球只有25磅的存量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only 25 pounds of it on the whole planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.32,0:40:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要感谢奥哈利的大力赞助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to thank Harry Osborn and Oscorp Industries for providing it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.76,0:40:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很乐意替你付帐单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy to pay the bills, Otto.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.44,0:40:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位先生女士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.51,0:40:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,系好安全带{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…fasten your seat belts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.14,0:41:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功达到核融合反应{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor, we have a successful fusion reaction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.48,0:41:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是令尊梦想不到的非凡成就{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a breakthrough beyond your father's dreams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.98,0:41:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.38,0:41:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们达到一百亿瓦的发电量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're producing a thousand-megawatt surplus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.99,0:41:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳的能量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The power of the sun…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.46,0:41:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在我的手掌心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in the palm of my hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.22,0:41:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,别惊慌 这只是跳电{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep calm! It's only a spike!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.95,0:41:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快就会稳定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lt'll soon stabilize!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.46,0:42:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 请尽快离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen, please clear the room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.53,0:42:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,（系统负荷过量）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.04,0:42:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,防护罩破裂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a containment breach!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.14,0:42:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥图 快回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otto, please get back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.24,0:42:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,快关掉 快关掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut it off, Otto! Shut it off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.45,0:42:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会稳定 我能控制它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will stabilize! It's under control!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.22,0:42:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿我作主{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in charge here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.25,0:42:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我出的钱 我作主{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my money! I'm in con…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.72,0:42:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是不原谅你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This doesn't change anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.06,0:42:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在干嘛？- 关掉电源{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - Pulling the plug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.87,0:42:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.05,0:42:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,萝丝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Osie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.25,0:43:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.65,0:43:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,差点就酿成大祸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was too close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.05,0:43:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,用超过一滴氚元素 纽约就毁了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he had more than a drop of tritium, he could have destroyed the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.53,0:43:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下我毁了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm ruined.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.60,0:43:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要跟蜘蛛侠算这笔帐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have nothing left, ecept Spider-Man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.27,0:43:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他救了你一命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He saved your life, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.37,0:43:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不屑他来救我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He humiliated me by touching me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.94,0:43:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,记者马上赶到 快走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The press will be here soon. I suggest we move on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.71,0:43:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跑来干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was he doing here anyway?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.06,0:44:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,熔铁贯穿他的脊髓腔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Molten metal penetrated the spinal cavity…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.63,0:44:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,脊椎多处受损{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and fused the vertebrae at multiple points…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.93,0:44:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括脊椎板和脊柱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…including the lamina and the roof of the spinal column.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.67,0:44:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要开刀 才能进行诊断{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won't know the etent of the damage until we get in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.00,0:44:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要锯断这些机械手臂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suggest we cut off these mechanical arms, slice up the harness…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.14,0:44:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,有必要的话 必须切除脊椎板{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and, if need be, consider a laminectomy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.68,0:44:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,并进行后侧脊椎融合固定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…with posterior spinal fusion from 7-T1 to T12.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.21,0:44:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're ready, doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.82,0:44:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人锯过木头吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody here take shop class?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.56,0:45:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！不！不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.30,0:45:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me! Help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.17,0:46:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.23,0:47:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,消息传开来了 到处都有谣言跟八卦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all over town, obbie. Gossip. Umors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.26,0:47:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸运的话 会引起全城恐慌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Panic in the streets, if we're lucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.60,0:47:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,疯狂科学家变成怪物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Razy scientist turns himself into some kind of a monster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.57,0:47:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的身上装了四只机械手臂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four mechanical arms welded right onto his body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.04,0:47:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,姓巴的家伙变成八手怪 太玄乎了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guy named Otto Octavius winds up with eight limbs. What are the odds?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.88,0:47:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,小何{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hoffman!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.82,0:47:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这怪物要叫什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we gonna call this guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.45,0:47:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 八爪博士？- 烂名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "Dr. Octopus." - That's crap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.85,0:47:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 章鱼科学家 - 逊毙了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "Science Squid"? - Rap!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.02,0:48:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怪异博士 - 这名字挺炫的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "Dr. Strange." - That's pretty good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.49,0:48:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜有人用了 有了 章鱼博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's taken. Wait, wait! I got it."Dr. Octopus."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.46,0:48:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我喜欢这个名字 - 当然啰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I like it. - Of course you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.33,0:48:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,章鱼博士 全新的大坏蛋章鱼博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Octopus. New villain in town."Doc Ock."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.30,0:48:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你真是天才 - 你等着加薪吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Genius. - What, are you looking for a raise?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.41,0:48:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,快滚吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.77,0:48:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,老板 我找到帕克了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hief, I found Parker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.21,0:48:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死到哪儿？没缴电话费吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you been? Why don't you pay your phone bill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.58,0:48:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没拍到疯狂科学家的照片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mad scientist goes berserk, we don't have pictures!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.08,0:48:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说蜘蛛侠也在场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard Spider-Man was there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.55,0:48:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,难不成你跑去拍松鼠吗？你被开除了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where were you? Photographing squirrels? You're fired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.32,0:48:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚的天文馆派对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hief, the planetarium party.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.82,0:48:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没被开除 我需要你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're un-fired. I need you, come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.66,0:48:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对上流社会了解多少？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you know about high society?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.39,0:48:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 我… - 你不用回答{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh. Well, l… - Don't answer that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.86,0:48:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来的摄影师被马球K到 我只有你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My society photographer got hit in the head by a polo ball. You're all I got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.46,0:48:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,为美国英雄举行庆功宴 我儿子是太空人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big party for an American hero. My son, the astronaut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.60,0:48:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能预支我薪水吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ould you pay me in advance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.41,0:48:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说真的？我付你钱傻傻地站着吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You serious? Pay you for what? Standing there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.05,0:48:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,明晚八点整 快滚吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The planetarium, tomorrow night, 8:00. There's the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.77,0:49:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我心爱的萝丝死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My osie's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.67,0:49:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的梦想破灭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dream is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.14,0:49:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And these…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.41,0:49:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怕的东西 应该沉下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…monstrous things should be at the bottom of the river…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.75,0:49:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,连我一起葬身河底{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…along with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.09,0:49:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的脑里…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.20,0:49:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个声音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in my head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.37,0:49:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something talking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.97,0:49:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,抑制晶片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The inhibitor chip!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.85,0:50:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不见了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.19,0:50:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,重头来过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ebuild.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.89,0:50:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.76,0:50:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得说的对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter was right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.53,0:50:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我算错了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miscalculated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.71,0:50:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不可能算错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't have miscalculated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.88,0:50:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,核融合不是成功了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was working, wasn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.72,0:50:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.18,0:50:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们重头来过 加大防护罩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could rebuild. Enlarge the containment field.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.35,0:50:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,让它比上一次更大更强{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make it bigger and stronger than ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.49,0:50:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们需要钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we need money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.09,0:50:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,去抢银行？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steal it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.60,0:50:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我不能犯罪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, I'm not a criminal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.03,0:50:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.27,0:51:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不完成我的梦想 才是罪恶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The real crime would be not to finish what we started.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.14,0:51:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在这里完成{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll do it here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.51,0:51:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳能量 就在我的手掌心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The power of the sun in the palm of my hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.12,0:51:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人能阻挡我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing will stand in our way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.79,0:51:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.52,0:51:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,（贷款部）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.53,0:51:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是我的社会保险 - 我看到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's the social security. - Yes, I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.36,0:51:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我班叔叔的寿险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My uncle Ben's life insurance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.30,0:51:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 但是很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but I'm afraid…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.73,0:51:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还是不够让你们重新贷款{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it's just not sufficient to refinance your home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.10,0:51:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又开始教钢琴了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, but I'm giving piano lessons again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.81,0:51:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.21,0:51:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你在本银行…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We appreciate that you've just opened up…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.62,0:51:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,开了一个超省钱帐户{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a new supersaver account with us today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.39,0:51:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the fact is…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.82,0:51:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的资产不足以重新贷款 很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you do not have the assets to justify this loan. I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.79,0:51:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个嘛…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.13,0:51:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我至少能拿到烤面包机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least we get the toaster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.13,0:52:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,存款要超过三百元 才有得拿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, that's only with a deposit of 300 or more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.00,0:52:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.81,0:52:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.51,0:52:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 一定会有办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, we'll figure it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.93,0:52:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.10,0:52:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,别把我丢下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't leave me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.87,0:52:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这孩子真是个大英雄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that boy of yours is a real hero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.81,0:52:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.81,0:52:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手举起来 全都举起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your arms up! All of them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.80,0:53:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是找你的零钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's your change!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.05,0:53:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,惨了 拜托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. Ome on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.99,0:53:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你把我给惹毛了 - 我专门抓坏蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're getting on my nerves. - I have a knack for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.36,0:53:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死定了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.70,0:54:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不准动 - 站住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Freeze! Don't move! - Freeze!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.43,0:54:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别开枪 - 别跟来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hold your fire! - Don't follow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.17,0:54:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.69,0:54:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把她交给我 - 没问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hand her over. - Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.70,0:54:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy, now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.67,0:54:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真是不小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Butterfingers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.65,0:55:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.05,0:55:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.15,0:55:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 救救我 - 我来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Help me! - I'm coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.99,0:55:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.66,0:55:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.19,0:56:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.09,0:56:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅婶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aunt May.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.59,0:56:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你未免也太多管闲事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've stuck your webs in my business for the last time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.76,0:56:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这老太婆的命 要算在你头上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you'll have this woman's death on your conscience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.34,0:56:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,来呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ome on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.95,0:56:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真不要脸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shame on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.38,0:57:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.98,0:57:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 我以前错怪你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Oh, have I been wrong about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.49,0:57:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把他打败了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We sure showed him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.92,0:57:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我把他打败的吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, "we"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.83,0:57:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,带我走 蜘蛛侠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take me with you, Spider-Man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.76,0:58:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来拍一张吧 - 好 拍吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- May I? - Sure. Go ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.43,0:58:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,潘妮 过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Penny! Over here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.70,0:58:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,别拿走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.27,0:58:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别喝这么多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Might wanna take it easy, buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.94,0:58:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,何不呢？这不是个派对吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? It's a party.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.44,0:58:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为 那疯子会让我名利双收{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't you be drinking if you lost a bundle on some crackpot…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.55,0:58:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果却被他弄得身败名裂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…who you thought was gonna take you with him to fame and fortune?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.28,0:58:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有那只大昆虫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to mention your friend the bug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.52,0:58:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚别提他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not tonight, Harry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.89,0:58:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我每晚都要说 我无论如何都要找到他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every night! Until I find him, it's 24-7.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.89,0:58:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.99,0:58:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.76,0:58:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你聋啦？我叫了你两次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parker! What, are you deaf? I called you twice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.00,0:58:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是请你来喝香槟吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think I'm paying you to sip champagne?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.17,0:58:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,替我老婆跟部长拍一张{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a shot of my wife with the minister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.54,0:58:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好帅的领带{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautiful tie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.97,0:58:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,替我们跟检察官拍一张{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a shot of us with the DA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.64,0:58:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好美的礼服{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautiful dress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.58,0:58:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,替市长跟他的二奶拍一张{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, get a shot of the mayor and his girlfriend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.65,0:58:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说老婆啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.22,0:59:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位先生女士 晚安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen, good evening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.65,0:59:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽约科学图书馆协会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The committee for the Science Library of New York…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.92,0:59:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,很荣幸介绍今晚的贵宾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is pleased to present our guest of honor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.29,0:59:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是第一个在月球踢足球的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the first man to play football on the moon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.16,0:59:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,英俊勇敢 秀色可餐的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The handsome, the heroic, the delicious…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.50,0:59:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹约翰上尉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…aptain John Jameson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.05,1:00:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.88,1:00:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是你 - 对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You. - Listen, I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.42,1:00:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天我有事耽搁了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there was a disturbance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.82,1:00:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经不认识你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.09,1:00:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能老是对你念念不忘 这太痛苦了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can't keep thinking about you. It's too painful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.90,1:00:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最近在读诗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been reading poetry lately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.73,1:00:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,随你便啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever that means.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.60,1:00:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他日复一日凝视着她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Day by day he gazed upon her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.54,1:00:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他日复一日为爱叹息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Day by day he sighed with passion Day by day…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.54,1:00:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,省省吧你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't start.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.88,1:00:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我替你拿杯酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An I get you a drink?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.85,1:00:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是约翰的女友 他会为我服务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm with John. He'll get me my drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.25,1:00:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.05,1:00:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰看过我的戏五次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, John has seen my show five times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.12,1:00:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利看过两次 梅婶看过一次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harry has seen it twice. Aunt May has seen it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.26,1:00:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我病重的老妈也来看过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sick mother got out of bed to see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.93,1:00:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,就连我那死鬼老爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.40,1:00:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,都跑到后台向我借钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He came backstage to borrow cash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.73,1:01:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但一向最关心我的好友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But my best friend, who cares so much about me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.27,1:01:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,却一次也没来过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…can't make an 8:00 curtain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.11,1:01:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,过了这么多年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all these years…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.01,1:01:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我来说 他竟是一张空座位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…he's nothing to me but an empty seat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.11,1:01:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你很不爽 你为了蜘蛛侠背叛好朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It pisses me off, your loyalty to Spider-Man and not to your best friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.64,1:01:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他杀死我父亲 你却为了靠他赚钱 替他辩解{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I find him with my father's body, and you defend him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.08,1:01:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 冷静点 - 别推我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Take it easy. - Don't push me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.32,1:01:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,别假装你是我朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't act like you're my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.89,1:01:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从我手上抢走玛莉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stole M.J. From me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.25,1:01:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也抢走我的父爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stole my father's love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.82,1:01:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不肯交出蜘蛛侠 把我爸害死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you let him die because you didn't turn in the freak. Isn't that right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.06,1:02:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不对？是不是这样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh? Isn't that right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.47,1:02:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好兄弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh, brother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.24,1:02:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 我要宣布一个好消息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen, I just want you all to know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.68,1:02:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,美丽的玛莉刚答应我的求婚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that the beautiful Miss Mary Jane Watson has just agreed to marry me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.66,1:02:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,太让人惊讶了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a surprise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.30,1:02:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,别发呆 快拍照{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parker, wake up! Wake up! Shoot the picture!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.29,1:03:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 惨了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.64,1:03:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么会这么衰？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is this happening to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.72,1:04:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,（蜘蛛侠和章鱼博士狼狈为奸）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.09,1:04:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你答应他了？这么快？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told him yes? Just that fast?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.86,1:04:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉很对阿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It felt right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.23,1:04:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该恭喜我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you might congratulate me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.37,1:04:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ongratulations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.44,1:04:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部的祝福都给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.87,1:04:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹很爱我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}John loves me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.87,1:05:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸总是说「你一文不值… 」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father always said, "You'll never be worth anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.75,1:05:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,「没有男人会要你的」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No man will ever want you."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.51,1:05:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又怎样 用你这一辈子接下来的时间…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, you're gonna spend the rest of your life…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.02,1:05:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,去证明你爸说的是错的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…trying to prove something to your father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.42,1:05:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的爱这家伙吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really love this guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.19,1:05:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很爱 - 「很爱」？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Very much. - "Very much"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.93,1:05:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样不够{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That just doesn't fly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.59,1:05:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 如果你真的爱这小子 答案应该是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, if you really love the guy, then the answer is:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.20,1:05:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱他吗？我爱他爱得要死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Do I love him? I adore him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.93,1:05:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他总是让我觉得很舒服{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's my comfortable afghan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.93,1:05:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都想着他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's all I can think about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.30,1:05:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的一切一切 他说的话 他做的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything he is, everything he says, everything he does…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.54,1:05:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我 为我 与我一起 甜甜的吻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to me, for me, with me, is sweet kisses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.11,1:05:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他抚平了我过去所有的悲伤和难过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He makes up for all the grief and pain I've ever had…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.08,1:05:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且他永远都在漫漫黑夜里守护着我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and in the dark of the night, he is there."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.22,1:05:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是我要的答案{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the answer I need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.16,1:05:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不只是「我非常爱他」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just "I love him very much."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.93,1:05:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看太多爱情故事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You read too many love stories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.66,1:05:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个你曾有过的… 超完美的亲亲是怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about that perfect kiss you said you had once?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.13,1:05:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你相信的那个家伙呢？- 那只是个幻想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The guy you believed in? - That was a fantasy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.80,1:06:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是关于他的一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.34,1:06:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是向往爱情故事 有什么不对吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what's wrong with believing in love stories?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.81,1:06:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,（学生健康中心）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.38,1:06:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没什么毛病{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seem very okay to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.05,1:06:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My diagnosis?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.92,1:06:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是心理问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.09,1:06:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你睡不着 你为了什么伤心或做噩梦吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say you can't sleep. Heartbreak? Bad dreams?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.30,1:06:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做了一个梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is one dream where…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.47,1:06:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这个梦中…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in my dream…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.10,1:06:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是蜘蛛侠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…l'm Spider-Man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.87,1:06:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我失去了超能力 我想飞檐走壁 却一直摔下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm losing my powers. I'm climbing a wall, but I keep falling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.01,1:06:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是蜘蛛侠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're Spider-Man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.78,1:06:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有在我的梦中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In my dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.18,1:06:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实也不是我做的梦 是我朋友做的梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, it's not even my dream. It's a friend of mine's dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.75,1:06:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以这是别人的梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's somebody else's dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.96,1:06:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你主修什么？戏剧艺术？- 科学{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's your maor? Theater Arts? - Science.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.16,1:06:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,康博士的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Onnors?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.56,1:07:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要把你当掉？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He flunking you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.33,1:07:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他可能会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says he might.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.27,1:07:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.58,1:07:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的这位朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about this friend?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.18,1:07:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为什么要飞檐走壁？他觉得自己是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why does he climb these walls? What does he think of himself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.02,1:07:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是他的问题 他不知道自己是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the problem. He doesn't know what to think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.59,1:07:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你不了解自己一定会发疯 灵魂会消失{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta make you mad not to know who you are. Your soul disappears.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.53,1:07:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种自我否定最可怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing as bad as uncertainty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.06,1:07:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也曾经这样 我的身份是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been there. Who was I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.87,1:07:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,身份 很重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Identity. Big one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.57,1:07:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我去找心理医生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, I go to my shrink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.51,1:07:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跟你说了什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does he tell you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.71,1:07:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说我需要放更多的注意力在目标上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She tells me I need some strong focus on what I want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.68,1:07:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得找出是谁不让我拥有它 为什么…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have to find out who won't let me have it, why…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.02,1:08:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我会拦截他 要他好好听着…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and then I have to tackle that guy, let him hear me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.19,1:08:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一件事 我必须确定我所要的是对的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And one more thing. I have to make sure I'm right about what I want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.20,1:08:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.87,1:08:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你不该当飞檐走壁的蜘蛛侠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…maybe you're not supposed to be Spider-Man climbing those walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.54,1:08:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你才会一直摔到地面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you keep falling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.74,1:08:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有选择的余地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always have a choice, Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.91,1:08:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是有所选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.72,1:08:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最近的这些念头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the things you've been thinking about, Peter…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.83,1:08:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我很伤心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…make me sad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.76,1:08:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你不明白吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An't you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.43,1:08:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我深爱玛莉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in love with Mary Jane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.77,1:08:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.67,1:08:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 我想你已经学到责任感的意义了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I thought you'd learned the meaning of responsibility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.21,1:08:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 你不懂那是什么感觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you don't know how it feels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.98,1:09:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前教你要见义勇为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter, all the times we've talked of honesty…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.19,1:09:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,铲奸除恶 伸张正义{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…fairness, justice…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.59,1:09:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都希望你能鼓起勇气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of those times, I counted on you to have the courage…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.60,1:09:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我的梦想发扬光大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to take those dreams out into the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.53,1:09:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能活在你的梦想中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't live your dreams anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.27,1:09:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要属于自己的人生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want a life of my own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.27,1:09:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拥有一个天赋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been given a gift, Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.71,1:09:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,能力愈强 责任愈大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With great power comes great responsibility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.55,1:09:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 握我的手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take my hand, son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.40,1:09:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 班叔叔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Uncle Ben.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.24,1:09:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是彼得·帕克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just Peter Parker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.24,1:09:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不再是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Spider-Man…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.84,1:10:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜘蛛侠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…no more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.54,1:10:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也不是了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.19,1:10:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也不是了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.01,1:11:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 臭小子 - 对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You punk! - Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.51,1:11:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢了 - 不客气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks. - You're welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.82,1:11:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.83,1:12:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,当零界是中子等于零 那么本正值是多少？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when the borderline is tau equals zero, the eigenvalues are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.71,1:12:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人知道吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone, please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.68,1:12:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,0.23电子伏特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}0.23 electron volts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.18,1:12:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你表现得很好 加油{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ecellent work today, Parker. Keep it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.66,1:12:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我人并不坏 千万别把我当坏人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not really wicked at all. You mustn't think that I'm wicked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.73,1:12:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是这样 你就是在骗我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you are not, then you have certainly been deceiving us all…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.74,1:12:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种行为不可原谅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in a very inecusable manner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.87,1:12:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你不是双面人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you have not been leading a double life…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.21,1:12:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,表面上耍坏 内心其实很善良{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…pretending to be wicked and being really good all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.58,1:12:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样就很伪善{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would be hypocrisy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.38,1:12:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前是有点坏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, I have been rather reckless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.59,1:13:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我很高兴」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I am glad."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.92,1:13:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我很高兴」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I am glad."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.26,1:13:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我很高兴」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I am glad."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.86,1:13:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这么说你不高兴吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you glad to hear it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.20,1:13:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很高兴…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am glad…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.70,1:13:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这么说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to hear it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.31,1:13:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我得承认…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, now you mention the subect…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.17,1:13:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是有点坏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I have been very bad in my own small way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.78,1:13:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你演得好棒 这出戏超好看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were so wonderful. That was such a great play.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.92,1:13:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该跟我说你要来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could've told me you were coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.12,1:13:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怕你叫我不要来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was afraid you'd say, "Don't come."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.19,1:13:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来不太一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.59,1:13:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我擦了鞋 烫了裤子 做了功课{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shined my shoes, pressed my pants, did my homework.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.70,1:13:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在都会做功课{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do my homework now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.70,1:13:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想吃炒面吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna get some chow mein?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.70,1:13:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.54,1:13:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要结婚了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…l'm getting married.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.05,1:13:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直想像你会在山坡上结婚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always imagined you getting married on a hilltop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.25,1:14:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,新郎是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who's the groom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.25,1:14:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还没决定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hadn't decided yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.39,1:14:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为来看戏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think just because you saw my play…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.66,1:14:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能阻止我结婚？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you can talk me out of getting married?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.33,1:14:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过你爱我 我以前不知好歹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You once told me you loved me. I let things get in the way before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.70,1:14:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为一定要做一件事 现在不必做了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was something I thought I had to do. I don't have to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.67,1:14:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,来不及了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.34,1:14:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你考虑一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you think about it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.87,1:14:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,考虑什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.37,1:14:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们重头来过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Picking up where we left off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.58,1:14:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,重头来过？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.04,1:14:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来没开始怎么能重头来过？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We never got on. You can't get off if you don't get on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.71,1:14:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为事情没这么简单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think it's that simple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.28,1:14:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 你老把事情搞得很复杂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you don't, because you complicate things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.72,1:14:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.85,1:14:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不再是个空座位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not an empty seat anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.86,1:14:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟以前不同{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.86,1:14:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,打我一拳我会痛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Punch me, I bleed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.13,1:14:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.71,1:15:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要在教堂结婚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting married in a church.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.65,1:15:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是跟以前不一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.57,1:15:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,（章鱼博士逍遥法外）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.07,1:15:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是场婚礼 别把我搞到破产{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dear, we agreed to put on a wedding, not go into bankruptcy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.01,1:15:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,鱼子酱？你邀请沙皇吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aviar? What, are we inviting the czar?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.77,1:15:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,弄点饼干和烤香肠就行了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get some cheese and crackers, some of those little cocktail weenies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.98,1:15:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,清洁队员找到一样好东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a garbage man here says he's got something you might want to see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.31,1:15:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你找到ET 有人已经捷足先登了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you have an etraterrestrial's head in there, you're the third guy this week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.55,1:15:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪儿找到的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell did you get that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.56,1:15:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,垃圾桶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the garbage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.26,1:15:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,垃圾桶？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the garbage?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.69,1:15:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定是不干了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must've given up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.76,1:15:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,举白旗投降了 不玩这个无聊游戏了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thrown in the towel. Abandoned his sad little masquerade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.34,1:16:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我终于把他整垮了 这是狗仔队的大胜利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I finally got to him. The power of the press triumphs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.64,1:16:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说是就是 我总有钱拿吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, yeah. Now, look, I think I deserve a little something for this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.61,1:16:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我给你五十块 - 我不如上网站拍卖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Give you 50 bucks. - I could get more than that on eBay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.88,1:16:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 一百块钱 顺便给他一块香皂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, 100. Give this man his money and throw in a bar of soap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.75,1:16:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,老板娘还在线上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your wife is still on that line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.12,1:16:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲜花？多少？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flowers? How much?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.52,1:16:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干脆拿花到我坟上上香吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You spend any more on this thing, you can pick the daisies off my grave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.89,1:16:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,用塑胶花{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get plastic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.26,1:16:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,有大新闻 我要挂了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta go, big story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.17,1:16:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,（蜘蛛侠玩完了）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.98,1:16:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜘蛛侠啊蜘蛛侠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spider-Man Spider-Man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.41,1:16:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到哪儿去了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where have you gone to Spider-Man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.58,1:16:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到哪儿去了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where have you gone to Spider-Man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.78,1:17:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 抢他的钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ome on, man. Get the money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.79,1:17:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ome on, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.99,1:17:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.43,1:17:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ome on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.38,1:17:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,（挚爱的丈夫和叔叔：班帕克）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.12,1:17:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死得好冤枉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't fair to have gone like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.52,1:17:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个好人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a peaceful man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.73,1:17:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都是我的错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it was all my doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.79,1:18:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅婶 你不该责怪自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aunt May. You don't have to punish yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.40,1:18:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I know I shouldn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.80,1:18:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是那天你要搭地铁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just that you wanted to take the subway…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.17,1:18:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他却要开车送你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and he wanted to drive you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.67,1:18:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我坚持不让他去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If only I had stopped him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.68,1:18:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就能一起喝茶聊天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd all three of us be having tea together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.59,1:18:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm responsible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.93,1:19:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.30,1:19:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该对他的死负责{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what happened to Uncle Ben.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.67,1:19:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那天在图书馆…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you were at the library.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.11,1:19:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,做功课{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were doing your homework.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.24,1:19:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他送我到门口 可是我没进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He drove me to the library, but I never went in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.21,1:19:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.58,1:19:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去了别的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went someplace else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.42,1:19:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想赢些钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someplace where I thought I could win some money…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.59,1:19:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,用来买辆车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to buy a car, because I wanted…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.39,1:19:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想用来追玛莉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to impress Mary Jane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.66,1:19:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情发生得太快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It happened so fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.83,1:19:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赢了钱可是对方不付钱 后来他遇到抢匪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won the money, and the guy wouldn't pay me. Then he got robbed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.20,1:19:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个抢匪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thief…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.64,1:19:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,朝着我跑来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…was running towards me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.21,1:19:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我大可以拦住他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could've stopped him, but I wanted…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.75,1:19:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我想报仇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…revenge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.28,1:19:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让他逃走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I let him go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.72,1:20:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让他逃走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I let him get away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.50,1:20:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他需要一辆车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wanted a car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.46,1:20:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想抢班叔叔的车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He tried to take Uncle Ben's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.00,1:20:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,班叔叔不肯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncle Ben said no…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.74,1:20:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以就被他开枪打死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and then he shot him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.51,1:20:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,班叔叔不肯向恶势力低头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncle Ben was killed that night…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.82,1:20:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那晚才会死在坏人枪下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for being the only one who did the right thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.09,1:20:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.80,1:20:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只能在他死前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I held his hand…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.43,1:20:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,握住他的手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…when he died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.54,1:20:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直想告诉你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've tried to tell you so many times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.17,1:21:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还得做一件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one more little chore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.44,1:21:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,（蜘蛛侠涉嫌杀死奥斯朋）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.41,1:21:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,（蜘蛛侠动用私刑）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.88,1:22:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.48,1:22:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 少爷 我要走了 - 你走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm leaving for the night, sir. - Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.48,1:22:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爷只为工作发狂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father only obsessed over his work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.39,1:22:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 伯纳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, Bernard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.37,1:23:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 哈利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Harry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.78,1:23:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥图 你要什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otto. What do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.61,1:23:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍贵的氚元素{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That precious tritium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.08,1:23:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次我要更多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I need more of it this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.48,1:23:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯啦？你会把纽约市给毁了 你这二流科学家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}More tritium, are you crazy? You'll destroy the city! You're a hack!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.39,1:23:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.60,1:23:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手 好啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Stop! All right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.03,1:23:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 好啦 放我下来 我们谈个条件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right, all right. Put me down. We'll make a deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.68,1:23:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了蜘蛛侠我就把东西给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill Spider-Man, I'll give you all the tritium you need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.78,1:23:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我改变主意 我要你活捉他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On second thought, bring him to me alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.79,1:23:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该怎么找到他？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do I find him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.36,1:23:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 彼得·帕克 - 帕克？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Peter Parker. - Parker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.19,1:23:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他替报社拍蜘蛛侠的照片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He takes pictures of Spider-Man for the Bugle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.63,1:23:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,逼他说出他的下落{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make him tell you where he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.93,1:24:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,把东西准备好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have it ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.07,1:24:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,别伤害彼得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't hurt Peter!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.71,1:24:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,（犯罪率上升75%）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.18,1:24:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,（蜘蛛侠在哪里？）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.85,1:24:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,救人啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody, help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.22,1:24:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,起火了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.00,1:24:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,老陈找不到他女儿 你有没有看到她？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alisa, the hens can't find their daughter. Have you seen her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.41,1:24:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快通知消防队 快呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody call the fire department! Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.78,1:24:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 救人啊 - 有人被困在里面？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Help! - Is anybody in that building?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.24,1:24:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,二楼有个小女孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We think there's a kid stuck on the second floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.08,1:24:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, where you going?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.94,1:25:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.93,1:25:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了 我会救你出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. It's okay. Ome here. I'm gonna get you out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.90,1:25:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ome on. Ome on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.59,1:26:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mama.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.58,1:27:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子 你真带种{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got some guts, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.31,1:27:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人被困在四楼 没逃出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some poor soul got trapped on the fourth floor. Never made it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.18,1:27:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.55,1:27:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,把东西收一收 走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Billy, let's knock it down and roll them up. Get on out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.19,1:27:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,收工了 我们走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's pick it up! Let's get all this equipment, let's go! Let's move it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.77,1:27:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道我不该得到我要的爱…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I not supposed to have what I want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.77,1:27:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,过我想过的生活吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I need?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.57,1:27:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该怎么做？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I supposed to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.68,1:27:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不该没敲门…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shouldn't have without…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.85,1:27:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,就闯进来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…knocking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.69,1:27:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,请进{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ome in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.36,1:27:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi. - Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.54,1:28:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想吃巧克力蛋糕吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like a piece of chocolate cake?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.14,1:28:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.01,1:28:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一杯牛奶？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a glass of milk?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.81,1:28:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would be nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.52,1:28:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.84,1:28:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.45,1:28:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人留言给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a message.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.18,1:28:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你的婶婶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your aunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.82,1:28:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.54,1:29:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.04,1:29:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们宽限我几个礼拜 不过我决定现在就搬家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, they gave me another few weeks, but I decided the hell with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.01,1:29:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到一间小公寓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm moving on. I found a small apartment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.91,1:29:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么不告诉我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you tell me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.48,1:29:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以自己照顾自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm quite able to take care of things myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.95,1:29:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,对面的亨利来帮忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Henry Jackson across the street is giving me a hand…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.52,1:29:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我付他五块钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and I'm giving him $5.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.19,1:29:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是亨利·杰克森？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Henry Jackson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.46,1:29:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,才过了两年 他就长这么大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. It's funny what happens in two years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.86,1:29:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他年纪小 志气却很大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nine years old, has great ambitions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.97,1:29:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于上次那件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, about my last visit…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.40,1:29:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了 别再说了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pish-posh, we needn't talk about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.94,1:29:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去的事 就让它过去吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's water over the dam or under the bridge or wherever you like it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.98,1:29:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能说实话 真的很勇敢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you made a brave move in telling me the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.02,1:29:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以你为荣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm proud of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.95,1:29:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I thank you, and I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.62,1:30:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很爱你 彼得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.19,1:30:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,很爱很爱你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So very, very much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.18,1:30:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的漫画呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Where are all my comic books?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.35,1:30:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那堆垃圾… 我都拿去送人了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those dreadful things? I gave those away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.29,1:30:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我把锅子装好了 - 谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I put the pans in the bo, Mrs. Parker. - Thank you, Henry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.73,1:30:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 彼得 - 嗨 亨利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi, Peter. - Hey, Henry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.46,1:30:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你长好高{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're getting tall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.96,1:30:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你把食谱跟厨具装在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry, why don't you put those cookbooks in with the mier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.24,1:30:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你专门替蜘蛛侠拍照{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. You take Spider-Man's pictures, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.01,1:30:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是以前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.48,1:30:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他人呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.01,1:30:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近 报上都没有他的照片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry and I agree. We don't see his picture in the paper anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.25,1:31:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.82,1:31:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 洗手不干了 - 为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …quit. - Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.23,1:31:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想做别的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanted to try other things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.30,1:31:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会回来 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be back, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.20,1:31:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不晓得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.90,1:31:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你猜不到他想当谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll never guess who he wants to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.31,1:31:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜘蛛侠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spider-Man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.24,1:31:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么？- 他看得出谁是英雄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - He knows a hero when he sees one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.31,1:31:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,很少人像他一样飞檐走壁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too few characters out there, flying around like that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.22,1:31:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,冒险救我这种老太婆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…saving old girls like me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.45,1:31:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,像亨利这种小孩子需要英雄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Lord knows, kids like Henry need a hero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.39,1:31:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,牺牲小我完成大我的英雄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ourageous, self-sacrificing people…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.43,1:31:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我们的好榜样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…setting eamples for all of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.23,1:31:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都喜欢英雄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody loves a hero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.93,1:31:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家会替他们加油打气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}People line up for them. Heer them. Scream their names.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.53,1:31:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也会在雨中守候多时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And years later, they'll tell how they stood in the rain for hours…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.87,1:31:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,只为了看一眼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…just to get a glimpse of the one…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.74,1:31:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,当初拼命救他们一命的英雄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…who taught them to hold on a second longer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.55,1:31:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信 每个人都拥有英雄本质{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe there's a hero in all of us…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.55,1:32:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,它让我们忠于自我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that keeps us honest…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.05,1:32:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我们力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…gives us strength…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.05,1:32:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们拥有高贵情操{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…makes us noble…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.02,1:32:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后让我们光荣地死去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and finally allows us to die with pride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.73,1:32:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然有时候必须牺牲小我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even though sometimes we have to be steady…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.03,1:32:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,放弃我们最珍爱的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and give up the thing we want the most.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.57,1:32:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至我们的梦想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even our dreams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.37,1:32:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜘蛛侠启发了亨利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spider-Man did that for Henry…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.28,1:32:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想知道他去了哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and he wonders where he's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.88,1:32:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他需要他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needs him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.15,1:32:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,替我把书桌抬进车库 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think you could lift that desk and put it into the garage for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.33,1:32:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要太勉强哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't strain yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.69,1:32:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.05,1:33:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,专心去想我要什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strong focus on what I want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.31,1:33:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.08,1:33:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.03,1:34:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的背{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.37,1:34:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的背{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.90,1:34:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定不邀请你的摄影师朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, you sure you don't want to invite your friend, the photographer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.80,1:34:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得·帕克？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter Parker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:35.20,1:34:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,确定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Positive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.74,1:34:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为他是你的好友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought he was your pal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.24,1:34:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 彼得·帕克？- 是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Peter Parker? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.48,1:34:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是个大烂人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just a great big jerk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.41,1:34:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,世上有太多大烂人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world's full of great big jerks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.72,1:34:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是大好人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're adorable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.89,1:34:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是穿了帅气制服{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just the uniform.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.79,1:34:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,把头往后仰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lean your head back for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.19,1:34:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 往后仰？- 快点啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Put my head back? - Yeah, just do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.66,1:35:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要把头往后仰？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just put my head back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.07,1:35:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.75,1:35:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.02,1:35:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又飞到月球上了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm back on the moon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.43,1:35:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也跟我一样吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You up there with me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.72,1:35:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 你吓了一跳吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hiya. - Surprised?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.05,1:35:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,吓了一大跳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.72,1:36:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你赶来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.62,1:36:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都还好吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.56,1:36:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以这么说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might say so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.63,1:36:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好笑 我不知该从何说起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is funny. I'm not sure how to begin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.84,1:36:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道人有时候都会自欺欺人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how our minds play tricks on us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.91,1:36:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也是 - 我就是最好的例子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tell me about it. - Well, mine did a real number on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.41,1:36:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那晚我听到你对我的告白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some part of me heard what you had to say after the show that night…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.25,1:36:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你为我改变了 只是我听不进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that you were different. But I didn't want to listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.69,1:36:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不敢相信你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was afraid to trust you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.36,1:36:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我最近想了很多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I've been thinking about it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.56,1:36:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 我也有话想跟你说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, there's more for me to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.90,1:36:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那晚我说的话没经过大脑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I maybe rushed into things. I thought…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.27,1:36:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你想说什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. What are you saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.61,1:36:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说的是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm saying…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.58,1:37:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我可以为你改变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I could be there for you, Mary Jane…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.09,1:37:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我办不到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.02,1:37:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也在自欺欺人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mind was playing tricks too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.97,1:37:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底爱不爱我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you love me, or not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.61,1:37:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.55,1:37:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.62,1:37:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不爱我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.10,1:37:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,吻我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kiss me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.53,1:37:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,吻你？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kiss you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.20,1:37:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要确定一件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to know something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.64,1:38:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,只吻一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one kiss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.59,1:38:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.77,1:39:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得·帕克…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter Parker…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.27,1:39:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟他的女友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and the girlfriend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.37,1:39:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.04,1:39:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你找到蜘蛛侠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to find your friend Spider-Man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.38,1:39:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫他下午三点到高塔找我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him to meet me at the Westside Tower at 3:00.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.22,1:39:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道他在哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know where he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.92,1:39:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找到他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.76,1:39:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我就剥了她的皮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or I'll peel the flesh off her bones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.76,1:39:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你敢动她一根寒毛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you lay one finger on her…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.93,1:39:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就怎样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll do what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.00,1:40:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,令郎的未婚妻仍然下落不明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still no word on the whereabouts of your son's fiancee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.91,1:40:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Jonah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.58,1:40:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是我的错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all my fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.85,1:40:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把蜘蛛侠逼走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I drove Spider-Man away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.45,1:40:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有他能阻止章鱼博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was the only one who could've stopped Octavius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.12,1:41:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.99,1:41:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜘蛛侠是个英雄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spider-Man was a hero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.53,1:41:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是不肯承认{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just couldn't see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.10,1:41:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.70,1:41:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,小偷！土匪！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thief! A criminal!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.60,1:41:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,（你的好邻居蜘蛛侠）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.94,1:41:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他偷走我的紧身衣 他是全民公敌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He stole my suit! He's a menace to the entire city!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.41,1:41:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要告那只臭蜘蛛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want that wall-crawling arachnid prosecuted!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.61,1:41:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要用蜘蛛丝把他吊死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want him strung up by his web!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.21,1:41:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要蜘蛛侠！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want Spider-Man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.05,1:41:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,（他回来了）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:56.34,1:41:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,她人呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.88,1:42:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不会有事 咱们谈谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, she'll be just fine. Let's talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.73,1:42:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.04,1:45:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要拦下那辆列车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a train to catch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.68,1:45:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.68,1:45:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,刹车失灵 停不下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! Help! I can't stop it! The brakes are gone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:14.80,1:46:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是蜘蛛侠 - 天啊 我们死定了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's Spider-Man. - Oh, my God, this is it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.54,1:46:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫大家抓紧了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell everyone to hang on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:19.11,1:46:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brace yourselves!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.16,1:46:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有什么妙计？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any more bright ideas?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:44.80,1:46:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有很多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a few, yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:08.52,1:47:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, watch out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:40.99,1:47:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢下来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're slowing down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.65,1:48:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice and easy, we'll go down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.62,1:48:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slower. Gently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.36,1:48:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还活着吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he alive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.18,1:49:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是个…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:02.68,1:49:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,年轻人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…just a kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:05.45,1:49:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我儿子差不多大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No older than my son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:26.64,1:49:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:32.84,1:49:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:43.95,1:49:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会告诉别人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won't tell nobody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:59.60,1:50:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜘蛛侠 你回来了真好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good to have you back, Spider-Man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:22.13,1:50:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's mine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:24.76,1:50:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得先过我这一关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to get to him, you got to go through me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.83,1:50:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:29.77,1:50:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.07,1:50:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:06.64,1:51:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我把他放哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you want him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:16.41,1:51:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,氚元素呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the tritium?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.43,1:51:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.93,1:52:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你跟我一样痛不欲生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If only I could cause you the pain that you've caused me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.73,1:52:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我先揭开你的真面目{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}First we'll see who's behind the mask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:12.40,1:52:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后看着你痛苦死去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can look into your eyes as you die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.64,1:52:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:19.54,1:52:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:21.85,1:52:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can't be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:29.82,1:52:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:32.56,1:52:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,她人呢？他把她藏在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she? Where is he keeping her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.33,1:52:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他把玛莉抓走了 - 他要的是氚元素{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's got M.J. - No. All he wanted was the tritium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:42.07,1:52:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,氚元素？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tritium?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.34,1:52:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他又要制造核融合机器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's making the machine again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.17,1:52:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时候纽约市会被他摧毁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When that happens, she'll die, along with half of New York.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:52.58,1:52:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他在哪里？- 彼得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now, where is he? - Peter…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:56.51,1:52:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了我父亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you killed my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:03.52,1:53:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,世上有比私人恩怨更重要的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are bigger things happening here than me and you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:08.36,1:53:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定要阻止他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harry, please, I've got to stop him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:21.74,1:53:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:24.51,1:53:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:27.58,1:53:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在跟你讲话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking to you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:29.68,1:53:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经拿到你要的东西 快放了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got what you needed for your little science proect, now let me go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:33.35,1:53:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 你会去报警{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't let you go, you'd bring the police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:35.39,1:53:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜘蛛侠死了 阻止不了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that anybody could stop me now that Spider-Man's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:38.92,1:53:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:40.62,1:53:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我才不信 - 由不得你不信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't believe you. - Believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:01.01,1:54:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,惊讶吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surprise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:06.78,1:54:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一松绑…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as you get free…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:10.59,1:54:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早该知道 小哈利没种杀你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have known Osborn wouldn't have the spine to finish you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:14.73,1:54:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,快关掉 否则你会害死更多人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut it down, Ock. You're going to hurt a lot more people this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:18.00,1:54:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意冒这个险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's a risk we're willing to take.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:21.47,1:54:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不愿意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:55.87,1:54:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on, Mary Jane!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:13.05,1:55:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Un!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:38.84,1:55:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次我看你要怎么逃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see you scurry out of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:05.04,1:56:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:37.37,1:56:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Octavius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:42.67,1:56:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一定要把它关掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to shut it down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:44.78,1:56:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 该怎么把它关掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please tell me how.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:46.51,1:56:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得·帕克？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter Parker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:51.52,1:56:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,聪明的懒惰虫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Brilliant but lazy."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:53.88,1:56:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况不妙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at what's happening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:56.29,1:56:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要毁了它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must destroy it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:03.79,1:57:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能毁了它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't destroy it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:10.67,1:57:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我故意的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:17.57,1:57:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟我说过聪明才智的道理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You once spoke to me about intelligence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:21.65,1:57:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说一定要用来造福人类{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That it was a gift to be used for the good of mankind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:27.05,1:57:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个特权{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A privilege.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:29.12,1:57:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些机械手臂把你变成怪物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These things have turned you into something you're not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:33.22,1:57:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,别听它们的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't listen to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:40.96,1:57:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的梦想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was my dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:42.70,1:57:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了伸张正义必须牺牲小我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes, to do what's right, we have to be steady…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:47.37,1:57:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,放弃我们最珍爱的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and give up the thing we want the most.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:50.71,1:57:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至我们的梦想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even our dreams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:58.38,1:58:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:07.42,1:58:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说的对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:11.03,1:58:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:14.83,1:58:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:20.00,1:58:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:26.04,1:58:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我该怎么摧毁它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, tell me how to stop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:30.11,1:58:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,太迟了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can't be stopped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:33.18,1:58:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,它坚不可摧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's self-sustaining now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:35.45,1:58:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快想办法 - 除非…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Think! - Unless…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:39.09,1:58:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,河水{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The river.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:42.19,1:58:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,用河水把它浇熄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drown it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:45.76,1:58:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:32.41,1:59:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:47.16,1:59:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:49.43,1:59:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:51.86,1:59:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真的很重耶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is really heavy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:17.89,2:00:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛莉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}M.J.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:20.72,2:00:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一我们没命…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In case we die…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:22.69,2:00:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是爱我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do love me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:24.83,2:00:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:27.03,2:00:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然你嘴里说不爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even though you said you didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:32.04,2:00:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会以怪物的身份死去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not die a monster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:39.80,2:01:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜我一直都…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I always knew…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:42.94,2:01:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…all this time…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:45.74,2:01:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真正的身份{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…who you really were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:48.15,2:01:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们不能在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you know why we can't be together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:51.92,2:01:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜘蛛侠永远都有敌人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spider-Man will always have enemies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:56.72,2:01:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能让你冒险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't let you take that risk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:04.13,2:02:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:07.16,2:02:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,都会是蜘蛛侠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…always be Spider-Man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:12.20,2:02:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟我不会有结果{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I can never be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:02.95,2:03:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛莉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary Jane!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:08.05,2:04:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:25.74,2:04:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:27.24,2:04:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:30.27,2:04:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:32.94,2:04:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:35.65,2:04:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我以为你… - 并没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I thought you were… - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:38.35,2:04:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我活在你心中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm alive in you, Harry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:40.62,2:04:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在轮到你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it's your turn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:43.55,2:04:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发誓要蜘蛛侠付出代价{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You swore to make Spider-Man pay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:46.59,2:04:48.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在让他尝苦头吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now make him pay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:48.56,2:04:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得是我最好的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Pete's my best friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:50.39,2:04:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你父亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:52.96,2:04:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太软弱了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're weak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:55.40,2:04:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一向都很软弱 除非你真的当家作主{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were always weak. You'll always be weak until you take control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:00.80,2:05:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你看到彼得的真面目{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you know the truth about Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:04.57,2:05:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就要学会坚强{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be strong, Harry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:07.11,2:05:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,替我报仇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Avenge me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:11.31,2:05:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 替我报仇雪恨 - 不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Avenge me! - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:38.03,2:07:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,打给黛博拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All Deborah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:39.60,2:07:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,外烩厨子吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The caterer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:42.43,2:07:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫她不要打开鱼子酱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell her not to open the caviar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:25.91,2:08:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非这么做不可{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had to do what I had to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:29.75,2:08:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛莉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary Jane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:32.25,2:08:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:34.75,2:08:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有你我活不下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't survive without you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:47.20,2:08:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不该来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:50.13,2:08:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你认为… 我们不能在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you think we can't be together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:54.27,2:08:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是请你让我做自己的决定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But can't you respect me enough to let me make my own decision?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:59.24,2:09:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道往后会很危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know there'll be risks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:01.91,2:09:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我要跟你一起面对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I want to face them with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:05.65,2:09:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不该被拆散{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's wrong that we should only be half-alive…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:09.19,2:09:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是不对的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…half of ourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:13.42,2:09:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:17.29,2:09:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在站在你的门口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So here I am, standing in your doorway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:22.00,2:09:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都在这儿守候着你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've always been standing in your doorway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:32.14,2:09:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在也该有人来救你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't it about time somebody saved your life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:41.62,2:09:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,说话呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, say something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:45.96,2:09:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 玛莉·珍·华森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Mary Jane Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:04.64,2:10:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧 大英雄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get them, tiger.{\r}
